{
  "title": "Terms of the AIRLOCK credit pool",
  "asOf": "10 November 2026",
  "claim": "Each term links to the line that enforces it, the proof or test that covers it, and a transaction that shows it; the limits are terms too.",
  "parties": {
    "lead": "These terms bind the pool, the card it funds, the issuer who runs both, the borrower who holds the card, and every lender who deposits. Each contract signs with the hash of the code it runs, read from the chain on 10 November 2026.",
